WEBVTT - Docsynecx 2-Minute Product Walkthrough Captions

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Docsynecx automates document workflows for finance and freight forwarding teams.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Chapter 1: Multi-Channel Intake. Bills and booking emails are ingested automatically from shared inboxes, vendor portals, and scan folders.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:29.500
Incoming PDFs, scans, and attachments are separated and routed without manual template setup.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Chapter 2: AI Field Extraction. Vision models extract vendor names, GSTIN, invoice dates, and table line items with 99.8% accuracy.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:59.500
All tax breakdowns, HSN and SAC codes, and line-item math are calculated and cross-checked automatically.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Chapter 3: Pre-Posting Guardrails. Every vendor bill is validated against the government GST 2B portal and existing purchase orders.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:29.500
Historical ledger duplicate checks prevent duplicate payouts before any payment reaches your approval desk.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Chapter 4: Zero-Touch Posting. Verified vouchers post directly into Tally Prime via native XML server integrations, leaving your books completely unchanged.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:02:00.000
Your team handles exceptions, not typing. Grow the business, not the data-entry desk.
